  "직원을 넣었습니다 — 다음 달 급여 대장부터 들어갑니다.": "The employee was added. They appear from the next payroll created.",
  "직원 정보를 고쳤습니다 — 이미 확정한 급여는 그대로입니다.": "The employee was updated. Payrolls already fixed stay as they are.",
