  "수출 건(수주)을 넣었습니다 — 선적 · 수출신고 수리 · 대금 회수 때 「다음 단계」로 넘기십시오.": "The export order was added. Move it to the next step when it ships, when the export declaration is accepted and when it is paid.",
  "선적으로 넘겼습니다 — 수출 매출 전표(외상매출금 / 수출 매출 · 영세율)와 매출원가는 다음 전표 만들기 때 생깁니다.": "Marked as shipped. The export sale entry (accounts receivable / export sales, zero-rated) and cost of goods sold are created in the next journal run.",
