  "대금 회수로 넘겼습니다 — 환율 차이 {0}원은 외환차손으로 전표에 들어갑니다.": "Marked as paid. The exchange difference of {0} won is booked as a foreign exchange loss.",
  "수출 건을 취소했습니다.": "The export was canceled.",
  "수출 매출은 선적일에 선적일 환율로 잡고(영세율 · 부가세 0), 대금 회수 때 환율 차이는 외환차익 · 외환차손입니다. 수출신고는 관세사가 하고 수출신고번호를 넣으십시오(영세율 근거) — 일반 원칙 · 세무사 확인은 선택.": "Export sales are booked on the shipping date at that day's exchange rate (zero-rated, no VAT); exchange differences at payment are foreign exchange gains or losses. A customs broker files the export declaration; enter its number (zero-rate basis). General principles apply; a tax accountant review is optional.",
  "발주를 넣었습니다 — 물건이 들어오면 「입고」로 매입과 재고에 넣으십시오.": "The purchase order was added. When the goods arrive, use Receive to record the purchase and stock.",
  "입고했습니다 — 매입(상품 · 부가세대급금 / 미지급금)과 재고 수불부에 들어갔습니다(재고 전표는 매입 전표가 대신).": "Received. It was recorded as a purchase (inventory and input VAT / accounts payable) and in the stock ledger (the purchase entry covers the stock entry).",
  "입고했습니다 — 매입에 들어갔습니다(직판 옵션 품목만 재고 수불부).": "Received. It was recorded as a purchase (only direct-sale option items go to the stock ledger).",
  "발주를 취소했습니다.": "The purchase order was canceled.",
  "입고하면 ⑫ 매입 관리에 매입이 한 건 생기고(같은 건 막기는 건너뜀), 직판 상품 옵션 품목은 재고 수불부에 입고됩니다.": "Receiving creates one purchase in purchase management (the duplicate check is skipped), and direct-sale option items are added to the stock ledger.",
  "휴폐업 조회가 꺼져 있습니다 — 정책 › 전체 설정 acct.biz_status_check 를 켜십시오(SUPER).": "Business status checks are off. Turn on acct.biz_status_check in Policy › All settings (SUPER).",
