  "답을 받았습니다. 확인이 필요한 표현이 있어 운영 확인 뒤 보입니다.": "Your answer was received. It contains an expression that needs checking, so it will appear after staff review.",
  "내 상품 문의에 답합니다 — 답 기한은 문의 뒤 {0}시간이고, 늦은 답은 판매 평가에 들어갑니다. 비밀글은 쓴 분과 운영 · 판매자만 봅니다.": "Answer questions about your products. Answers are due {0} hours after a question, and late answers count toward your seller rating. Private questions are seen only by the writer, staff and the seller.",
